/*
:name: spec_types_cast_u1_bool
:type: comptime
:verifier_pass: 2
:verifier_fail: 0
*/
// SPEC qa.md appendix section 1: "Casts/conversions use the type names: `U1(flag)`, ...". docs 04-variables
// "Boolean": "The idiomatic bool->bit conversion is `U1(b)`". Rule: U1(true)==1, U1(false)==0.
cassert(U1(true) == 1)
cassert(U1(false) == 0)
